<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="336.164" endTime="357.962">
<Sync time="336.164"/>
Pos no: *igual** se: kichihchi:wa ke:meh n..., ke:meh n' okseki kilit, no: *igual**, no: mah se: k..., mah se: ka:mana.
<Sync time="340.882"/>
*o** no: weli yeh no: we:lik a:ko:loh.
<Sync time="343.23"/>
