<Turn speaker="spk1" startTime="390.967" endTime="394.564">
<Sync time="390.967"/>
¿Wa:n yo:n ikowyotsi:n no: se: kkwalia oso sayoh iwiw?
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk2" startTime="394.564" endTime="397.991">
<Sync time="394.564"/>
Weli se: kikwa n' ikowyotsi:n, tein sehselik kwali se: kikwa.
</Turn>
<Turn speaker="spk1 spk2" startTime="397.991" endTime="402.286">
